  /* ── RECOGNITION — the citation index ───────────────────────── */
  /* Replaces the one-line .tally__raw fallback, which set every award at one
     size in one colour: the repeated "Official Selection" was as loud as the
     festival names that actually differ, and on the one work with two awards
     the whole thing ran together into a single line. The festival carries the
     display type here; the honour is a label above it. */
  /* NO RULES, THE SAME DECISION THE TALLY BAND ALREADY MADE. The block further
     down strips that band of "its two rules and its cell hairlines"; this one
     arrived from the draft still carrying a rule above it and a hairline
     between every row, which put lines back into the one part of the page that
     had deliberately given them up. Separation is space here, matching the gap
     the tally uses. The margin is the tally's own, so both bands sit the same
